{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1256,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec2dcd217619ccd3f7aba65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……调整完美无缺。\r\n胜利就跟手到擒来没两样──\r\n训练员君，你就好好期待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9847d5fd05664b942120ed13af0bab5947cf8628a6985ff40c77927278d873",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca5643eb391c0fa3ac767eac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一切都是为了这天……\r\n接下来只要向众人证明\r\n我们的理论是正确的就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c88b35b8a374fa4374675f2d23091fbee72fdf872be0b3eadc3b7568239e5ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab5f11f7861da142564f3ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况良好，再来就是最后的一步……\r\n训练员君，拜托你激励我。\r\n你的一句话就是通往胜利的关键！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf3692e581150c8da99743287779b6cdd75602b51fca16a15c1912596535a15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c55b2d921fa01cf5ecf28bd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态调整得大致如预期。那么……\r\n正式上场时也只要照我们的预测，\r\n拿下胜利这个结果就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41d7f765e49814e934c6ad8504877bf13dbe2c35633b6af7a6539cb0f316f79e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb93ebcb56acc47a97d4d61f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备就绪。你也……\r\n嗯，你的表情很不错。\r\n这样我就能放心作战了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f53cd0e7348079a23a508f9318eb5739c8484bc426d10a99d531d9b3172a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be00ac7e6300b067cb355eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了……这场比赛就是重要关头。\r\n我要向一路累积而来的努力，以及\r\n一连串的方程式发誓……绝对要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6121e3a8997dfe085370664db511ca6438234e8afc4ab87d860dfe7eb63399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4561a298284f13236af2eee1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们是以平均值为基准\r\n进行调整的。换句话说，\r\n即使状况平平也不成问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1caa66589deb15a375a2fcd800fdb7a91ae26824b4b528df3e31d86a3148265d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f466914fc82c7e3bc089123e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况不好不坏……\r\n就是要考验我在正式比赛时的\r\n临场反应……是吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b758e31e71454f6a1f1956d3be8458d20936a16a44ebe0ec1a3547a7eb69cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9217b9e2b559ab9d58206f66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就利用这场比赛……\r\n来验证我们的理论是否正确吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02d45b0cd2cb04869633fbb64b01ba37db2b8ee0a467874812f596cc2bfc4566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1672561191f365ad9bfe00c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想必没问题……才是。\r\n只要能发挥平常的表现就行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5197c47d9a0cc31c02ae61dafc4281a4b32c53052343803d30b32dfef5ecaff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07e8d641b10c307f3666d989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对调整不满意，\r\n不过每个人的时间是公平的……\r\n接下来……就靠毅力去挑战吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51dc9613082b529c49d88fdc6901eacfa20d64a336cbdb9314385d603070233b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba082e82710357a9aff193e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对调整怀抱着些许不安……\r\n先把临时改变计划的可能性\r\n也纳入考虑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "497eef680e452821b7e818c8e5d19554b9faf3a298c227d6fde9842628927596",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:767f19b313b72f04cc627975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "问题越困难，\r\n解开时的喜悦也会越大。\r\n没错，我……不会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "864659c4d0e1397775b60814712b3ead2800c5ea83dc55c9c30ebb31056243d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e5c8c6adfa7c63321a3d79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你是在紧张吗？\r\n的确，调整可以说是糟透了。\r\n所以……我才要加油。就是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6d464780eb6534b11f70286f947ab2c07758c07d96a6db61de9e6d943cac37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d6251c25c219ebfb0863b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不追求什么奇迹。\r\n在跑步的当下我也会重新建构理论。\r\n我想要的就只有胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66e9b1d4caa3e3b10c30577f2dc68343a662b9b3988420f23b90522b0fbe0e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65f7245a41bc0f6ed732e096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee2fdfae675ec56b2f5da45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0157e6aed55c5c02d6a5db10de6381ff48cf5d42afdf83c802629cb18e71b92a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2a07b712f01dd611dbd502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93d3b7ef27d7cc0857d72ec2a4909bbb86efae229156b450540a7bebfc972c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d26bc1cb4e0b799c06d571",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ff4925698843c3792c7f0bc377e245a84f32db565113d4ccaa189fe812f9dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f614ab12466ee265ed5f838",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0024bd9c7e6a1e58e5d93f901b33058afae19cf6531d0d7c9688687f18d2005e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f00ed88c5f38076b61af95c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6d8458e0d0c283a28cdf0b2904ed93a7dfbc7b68b667ed9ee61b5a7aaf69e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b55ef498a30de79b90c12ce3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb68552f124570bd5245c78bdd75a028b4df21ce5b7bd41549967729dbf58354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ef50cbce88d121efa5e965",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "975f803e947bf9ffbcfaaef4f8f40dc399863b4571d748b93298cd7656b9edad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be12f26263fdfed00893a4e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又离完成更近了一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26098eb196c97a1bb0206f2a7afdb1eaff72b8c8e1657396fe9ebee556f6f6e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00883ed61f2e403d0325d7fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员君。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9af3af62964dff2d2a52e2d154d5948ec8553f2125507d64cdb6fa018e54727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a359dd821d3b693e08b00fc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有效率地进行锻炼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ed97b85f9e0d144b8609c3efa5b2099ed04f9c4294744839ac6522138e96ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a31f5e0b95b9a9f4cfa88541",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，去挑战吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1a602f76e0821564afc652f284f3f09fbdb4d7fa777de6ee1a11303e1db441",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0811ce8df614a823df038198",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，就依照作战计划进行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55341cc92e865a811dce4c4b938250d93fcf47e0da4813270775fe711a2b8ddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd462d81d3265fc033deda4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe14dbaa33cedbb8817cc5c67738ef9044c00c157d89590bd87233379d01774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a737a24083fe1027eb3038f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了……这场比赛就是重要关头。\r\n我要向累积至今的努力，以及\r\n写下的方程式发誓……绝对要赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a9b51cd2e2a3e18201f1453b992c40cf27ae6297df343ff5f10fce9b1acb19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48078405f73bb18fe87b53d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况良好，再来就是……最后一步。\r\n训练员，拜托你激励我。\r\n你的一句话就是通往胜利的关键！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab6ea923375dae7af78f1557b890e02108150c5ea757b89395f64a5e27bc944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47a860b7f202539680f6e49a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe14dbaa33cedbb8817cc5c67738ef9044c00c157d89590bd87233379d01774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3575cd59f01d150424fc503b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めようか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64a83ada31fcd254c92b8bc8e60c0d781207c215eb83bdec94794f4be2e9d8f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09264200cd70d8312796bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看见通往第一名的轨迹了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c6a60d296f5fda854b2f5dcd1b02d3d54a64ab5f4a5ada56a5daaeabef3a572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f89b91f8a73bd4f2102b13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，都在预测范围内……不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "041c7da9588793b0a047ba984db794fe8afe0c462b054ed55db86c2553bf3202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bd7a967e0eb05852392786a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "方程式需要进行调整。",
      "source_fingerprint": "380cad4c1cc347bc7936cd6f49fe2780749699559a74698ea6d468ebef711d76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ea07ef36dc1c75577c5496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我导出的解答有错……是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd3f001492ab110754555372beca8c74b712f74d79e1f1b048b2efdc3b3d359f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66efdb3749c390e3f2ef9454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……怎么样，看到没……呃，你靠太近了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99978b0c341fb4e9c6cb1fec335690c4b78e22a3768b5027bfdac257304999d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f6c8cd770037eee2e1aef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……我料到了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee26bb98253b159107f41a782ada2b5647b6f94752b52e426c1d4da60d3ccef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa3f5cc140be0306f5782bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎能听见祝福的铃声……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f039a7376c20b2aeac1d67e030f1224cb440a979440992037cb6776d90836cdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1bd5dc2fed78d83f3dbc8f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……可以说是如我所料吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd023921aa99cf33e892f09b83be49f5f8c9f674bc1b342176bb3d1551d4f062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c22c8c9625a9920b1d8ccac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Q.E.D.…\r\n分析通り、だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2c672ed0578fd7efeb3a141edf5b738d2956a27c5178d7f6924c5cd74c41ef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d639819935defb8a90904dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふむ…予想的中、だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17593423b53ecf6d4caeac6efbaa4bce70e52bf4bf717b00e2e42cf1100bd4e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cdfbb253d30f852b761b005",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6b1ef5593a4e5ff1facc80d4025d0d09989674f2a2a5cc52f5a1e732997d9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f868d34f463e84ab3c5d65f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是我所求的解答！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acfb7f724119f5add8351a0f068dc71dd77fe358e7323cef74def1004ed86a62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6991a52135c463ef1947da14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，进行准备吧。\r\n大进应该会觉得冷，\r\n要先让她穿暖一点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cfdecbd2de9b36efd3d5e9f7f27511b1f3db4f54a990934ed966c61b3da662c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4684f7839054285ecaf0a56f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阅读研究纪录，我对这个世界的\r\n技术了解越多，求知欲就越强。\r\n这里的世界观真是太惊人了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd283085f96369a283f8213f3eba96bae623cad11a4380b6a007bc60b0c3e4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7663ee5f07b0084bd3986e13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不擅长应付小孩……\r\n但或许以前陪伴白仁时，\r\n体力上还更加吃力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89010246d51a286e18d423a95b821daf188dd0a18d423c7f82da7fb6cfb710b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945244a1d15f8b91be73b356",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断验证并精益求精……\r\n这就是──「我的方程式」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3908e89012e39964634c8e054edd8a0844a8edd7c4c0ce470926d3ba4b115a2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b499f8442acfdee13e42fef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有这么好的朋友，我真的很幸运。\r\n就顺着她们的好意，\r\n今晚好好悠闲地享受聊天吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13d756eed747d516a374204e606bfd1cfb9b1296060818a761dd8797a2e4a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9740e589b2bdddef4efc5ded",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对要实现自己的梦想。\r\n也叫上奖券她们一起去训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a359a374dc98679a897c694c6be4e1cc3e40d352f9dba45030599c6c408ed4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b81d10cd6c35d8891baa9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务在这里。\r\n仔细确认过规则了吗？\r\n凡事的事前准备都至关重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb4987ba4371132dfb5c480420fd5908fdd58abf664dd61b304ccb96fc854c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00b26b6cbe46a4f35bd99026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有忘记领取的东西吧？\r\n任谁都有可能大意，\r\n事事多加小心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "380c32f3a8ebbb6b1e687df3496bd36494654b47350b30d9ed1fbd45c04bd3dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e85b0ffc24c3542a1798b969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名为胜利的礼物，一定会交到你手上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "958f26adfb19535af6862720c5897dbc0a184c08c3045de0b05478b13b1ed40d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9faf6b1ad8083c0d5d840e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在活用先人技术时，\r\n还得一并传承前人的意志才行──\r\n我是这么认为的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63f72be9a657902024de5fad1aa63489c4ffcf941e34eacf9066101b0292d9a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "400032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:200c6414bb4c77f7b408b847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对星光闪闪的天空干杯！对雪花飘飘的街道祝福──！\r\n……呃，喂！我的头一点也不大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d371cbcdbd23f2bdf1221d3121a007d4a7e06b52f6cc190d13e15ef5ba70a3ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6890d11e9566562ccbfb166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リミッター解除――出力全開！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6802cf238c676f8dd3564a3b134374e8f51e27bc9c1774bc638d52e1775d26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2badbe37bab69715be8b9ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アクチュエータ、正常。主動力、フル稼働。\r\nロボティクスの力、お見せしよう――いけぇッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2d426ae9dd717564d226961ab1db7e046e6cd3bab18887417c8f2d6000bc2ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:237ca8de91ff7bb9d37e9807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a8e24f90cd4cee7b85d86a761229a975aa6276f070c63c399e4666d3e4647c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a625d6081c0f63bc1d6a44bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b54539d912762dea6da6f5e6fafe79020ecf89c9e8a57ebc14fc472038336bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16fec081d28e13b72e80eff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf5055283e158bef7a6e8fc441801fc3374bf4287fd113d9b70a0be38cabcb12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d1b6e118d767c8c30e0c815",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf5055283e158bef7a6e8fc441801fc3374bf4287fd113d9b70a0be38cabcb12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88c3e0fd99eef0d40bcb3de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3206be42d6fb0b4e0199b8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b06725fda1d9e5f13f168658",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d264d03e7d8e5c9efe5b7f7e0b00b44c8c02904342dffc94475681ccb9893872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78daa206a5e7474ecc970d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d264d03e7d8e5c9efe5b7f7e0b00b44c8c02904342dffc94475681ccb9893872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb0506ff22ee48f5c80d4bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d264d03e7d8e5c9efe5b7f7e0b00b44c8c02904342dffc94475681ccb9893872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56d4c75feea0ffcc59b3ab6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要紧，正式上场时我会照着练习去做……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5436d9c185344e9a81226387e453305383d5b9d94311cfc8a01267e775afa7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59928aecc2f0152e3859d4f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是跳舞，我也会拿出自己的解答！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6cb902c9c7a40f773b2a3a39c6ad3298d30229127f30f526aea19d4a3447db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08dba647e1a3e6c371d47ca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起……找出胜利的方程式吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71a957185042c903ca80ba682e866987da06a3a7a504379c6b198dd9fee007d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:480707355841f00996d25d99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员君和我相遇，\r\n发誓完成「方程式」的那时吗……\r\n……我想那八成是必然的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91377f5f70047d03323202028c89aebd1092134be437b126572ac4baf764ccbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95d06c8330272be21382838b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服便是学生的证明。\r\n仔细打理是不可或缺的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04fbb14ebc16ab2673f492ceb758c1f00eae116f99c7b6fddc66086a31cfb29b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca847f301f4d41dbcc795b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live和比赛都一样，\r\n需要不断钻研以面对挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9fa765aabc326f0c72e9ab8dff29b80e0a11e865f30c896db5ead35cc2eee5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36b64b06583a89f0e989cf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服令人印象深刻，\r\n很不错吧？刚开始……\r\n我有点害羞就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a06817ab31a193c2d066f1d16e1a15e2600f219723ffa70a1d7e43ac38777e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ccc919ac0bc4585daf4129a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我来说果然太可爱了。\r\n……虽然我很中意啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc8ddc0765ca43d548a8216f4247c444739526ca75c245aad4f59ef8660d2d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8aab3cd5e79c0852c355a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧身的舞台服装，\r\n也可以当作体态管理的指标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e450bbe0bcafae70a924141a907196946006f55115c3d472dea5bc8007d2e977",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a7f27e4909e9be89e20b46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌上这套决胜服──\r\n我会建构起胜利的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4b8b0e3dffdadea631d8f3c3f089c82124978196fe59964a4575abae6031a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ffaab7dadb4060dfe502c10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这剪裁亮丽又优美对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75f38dd9e11f828327262fb113b6817796b5a2488841dfd8f3ca470344a954a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c75e896161e4a050b5e80d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有成为带给大家梦想的存在吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b2958bc5f4c1d724e121fecad8c64fa07d351f50a05685decf6ba750195ab9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9425bf0c3d03bf004bcf4fc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b54539d912762dea6da6f5e6fafe79020ecf89c9e8a57ebc14fc472038336bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1023",
        "70018"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
